  "scope": "CurrentSliceCatalogReviewRecords",
  "purpose": [
    "Provide the canonical index of substantive catalog review records for the current Character creation slice.",
    "Bind each reviewed catalog to its record artifact, task, identity count, source dependency, current status, blockers, issues, decisions, fixtures, tests, and completion prerequisites.",
    "Allow Chronicle delivery infrastructure to discover and validate catalog review records without hardcoded Werewolf-specific paths.",
    "Prevent omission of a required catalog review record from the review workflow."
  ],
